{"signature": "7cb02b8489c6c672bb54a4718d194b72b4ba5be12d9aa6fd786036d9396a6d02", "result": {"checks": {"check": {"scope": {"id": "check", "service": "slack", "file": "messages/*/2025-09.json", "pointer": "", "field": "user", "values": ["EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID"]}, "matches": [{"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/0", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "88e945b35bb589dc394d8a991183fcbb", "ts": "1756709266.660479", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Good morning, guys. reminder that we have a floating holiday today for the [NATIONALITY_0151] crew:saluting_face::flag-tr:", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 5, "name": "flag-tr", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 4, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0033_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0033_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/10", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "cce3ba6ad1cd07f025530278207125f2", "ts": "1756898577.849199", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey, guys. I'm running a horrific fever. I generated a few images for the effect intro screens and working on levels beyond 120+. If I feel better I'll join the POD meeting but I'll be AFK in general. :face_with_thermometer:", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": "1756898577.849199", "reply_count": 3, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1756964274.432429", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 6, "name": "thermometer", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 5, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0002_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "sob", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0031_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/13", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e8947e569abc9db679f323403d0e60e8", "ts": "1756964274.432429", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Thanks, guys. I feel better this morning.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": "1756898577.849199", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/29", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "a3bec946f9b8ccc80fa0b2ac9522603f", "ts": "1758557278.344569", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "We started the meeting Leonard I'm taking notes for you guys.", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/30", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2efc947811769a89d3561ec48ce75bf9", "ts": "1758557310.184109", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Should we postpone or cancel? There are many bugs but prioritzation needs yours and [PERSON_NAME_0054]'s input I think", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C05KNDCHAAG/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/32", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "da49fe06f6c12f71c67a9da488b3f4a3", "ts": "1758558302.777379", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Here are the updates:\n\nArt:\n\n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0040] is working on new objects. \n\u2022 Martin has posted progress in the art channel. \n\u2022 Marcus is going through the polish list. \nEngineering:\n\n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0029] is working on the icons, (they need some feedback from [PERSON_NAME_0054]) after that he'll continue working on the queue manager. \n\u2022 Samuel is fixing the list of bugs [PERSON_NAME_0050] gave him. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0022] is clearing up the backlog of his various features that need improvements or bug cleaning. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0120]'s Infinite branch is ready to be merged, blessed by [PERSON_NAME_0050], and he's working on Apple/Google login. \n\u2022 [PERSON_NAME_0067] and Douglas feature completed Win and Collect, and will potentially give us a test today. But they anticipate some edge cases so this test isn't a final product test. \n\u2022 Douglas is dealing with other backend tasks, his plate is pretty full. \n", "channel": "C05KNDCHAAG", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-3", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/3", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "34922c10225fe7574d528d23bba8ddd8", "ts": "1756832002.751049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Level 5 and 33 fix\n\n`47c56c761d650cb9a2b3fc26aaf8127a57fdb38c`\n\nLevel 20-40 nuke balance\n\n`4fc3a60110823cf86b40339847dfb0e94b6b4ce7`\n\n<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID>", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/27", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "30a4f0fdc9527785393995052f7823b3", "ts": "1757008572.993629", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID> Tomorrow morning, when you get a chance, can you please write a few scripts that checks if any levels have remaining boss buster items, or zombie types that aren't varC tagged?", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 13, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1757062878.243419", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/31", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7beb91065a05a2342163ad9a659025cc", "ts": "1757009163.675589", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No I don't dare :smile:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/36", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "50f159fdbd6a9d02ce25d5a331fc730f", "ts": "1757009292.900589", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": [{"blocks": [{"alt_text": "a man in a suit says oh thank god for that", "block_id": "945e7ee3-85ef-44cd-8de0-08a5ad68dad5", "fallback": "220x220px image", "image_bytes": 293084, "image_height": 220, "image_url": "https://media.tenor.com/y4YpFIIyMywAAAAM/simon-pegg-shaun-of-the-dead.gif", "image_width": 220, "is_animated": true, "title": {"emoji": true, "text": "GIF", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "image"}], "fallback": "shared a GIF", "id": 1}]}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/38", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "fed1c6e65960c840b45b93ffa245cfb0", "ts": "1757011652.972019", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No, if yours are working for sure we can just use these", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757008572.993629", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/58", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9e6a2dab0f336ea311957364fcab8361", "ts": "1757062878.243419", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's all good, [PERSON_NAME_0120]. Thank you very much :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C08