ld": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "88b159491a5bb0e69871bc890b1b2957", "ts": "1757957142.571079", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> Can I Push a level directly to main? It's a level4 update :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 2, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1757960012.551079", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/162", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e150eb030d064ef47f17cfa37df9db5f", "ts": "1757960002.924599", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I made a PR :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/163", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7533b9d9485a2806cc2604e5c3a47dcf", "ts": "1757960012.551079", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "`[PERSON_NAME_0019]/[USERNAME_24414]`", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1757957142.571079", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/354", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "fa816cf085e2bca93dd57c60e0e5bd70", "ts": "1758218113.761459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah I did a second difficulty reduction for the level", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758216361.448149", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/355", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c72551dec63e94b1abdddf12a2737457", "ts": "1758218118.576619", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's live", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758216361.448149", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/356", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "366b2cdd6d1f6ef892ac3c12b90368ac", "ts": "1758218145.027389", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah sure, I'll send a version for it in the sep30 branch", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758215775.137159", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/414", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "34ccef423a6b14a219bcfe3a60f1db52", "ts": "1758825042.029059", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> I made the level PR on the same branch. Feel free to merge whenever you want for the submission. :saluting_face:", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1::skin-tone-6", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/420", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "869fa65e0de361dce081d4eb332a7e3c", "ts": "1758905803.504279", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0025_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0032_SLACK_ID> Hey, guys. I have a small update about the levels. So, I know I committed to not using too many zombies on the screen or not too many zombies of the same kind. But after level 200+ I have to increase the item count so I need more meat. Which inevitably means more zombies. Furthermore, since we're trying to Push the game to a zombie focused gameplay, I need to create scenerios where a zombies speed makes them take the lead in the horde and screws everything over if you don't freeze or use AoE effects correctly. I'm still trying to be minimal about this but I can't keep up with it forever especially in levels 300+. I know you're trying to fix it and There is no immediate fix for the zombie memory thing just yet, but I needed to give you the heads up. There is a limit to which I can design around this issue we have and I'm at the limit basically.", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/430", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f9bb161d2a7caee22e59dc21f8db666a", "ts": "1758915229.664119", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I still need a few monsters to see a meaningful splash", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906955.330199", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/431", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "916a65ff5194ce6e0dabdc6de6f3dfbe", "ts": "1758916738.235669", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "No engineering work needed initially, we can just copy paste monsters and give them more HP", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906988.241999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/432", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2cb97869d35557d398bb0631b0ad539c", "ts": "1758916770.218659", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Engineering work will be required when they grow algorythmically. But initially we can start with what we have", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758906988.241999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C0880U9751A/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/440", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7a9fe614494b8e2f6dfd89b36c666fe2", "ts": "1758918861.648089", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Okay, I'll pick some", "channel": "C0880U9751A", "thread_ts": "1758917744.675749", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/3", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0ba65b7b67bcf3d957262d64d4a88c2f", "ts": "1756749524.040319", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Mine seems okay, I'm not going to pull anything then", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/143", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "85210459e883902b4bed8ef64e7d7938", "ts": "1756924317.041059", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I made it easier ti avoid nukes. I'll look again", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": "1756922647.135449", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/199", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1a1298229828547a48598ad613f6ad12", "ts": "1757115577.972499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Up to you, boss.", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/207", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "3a7623e142665c359d86fc91b8dfdc1c", "ts": "1757115647.762919", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": [{"blocks": [{"alt_text": "a close up of a white cat 's face with blue eyes looking at the camera .", "block_id": "e91c757c-65c6-4782-96e9-034f00396b86", "fallback": "220x220px image", "image_bytes": 28751, "image_height": 220, "image_url": "https://media.tenor.com/ZyqhFIPi2OgAAAAM/cat-crying-cat.gif", "image_width": 220, "is_animated": true, "title": {"emoji": false, "text": "GIF", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "image"}], "fallback": "shared a GIF", "id": 1}]}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/208", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "75c4140332cbbf240519f5e601ff2e7f", "ts": "1757115653.542019", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Which levels?", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/213", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e01aab3bb895b463fc29754969fc8338", "ts": "1757115778.969739", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Okay making PR then?", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/215", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "35c45375af217a07193be0f743086f79", "ts": "1757115837.898989", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Okay, I'll make the PR and go to bed. If you guys make a test, I'm happy to put in a shift tomorrow :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "gratitude-thank-you", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/391", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9d4193dbee34ae99e8d5d87342e248d3", "ts": "1757272160.545609", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'll adjust it tomorrow morning :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": "1757208847.204209", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R27X0EAH/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/420", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "eaf99c44f6c8849438399e421afd94b9", "ts": "1757349785.790919", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "`All compiler errors have to be fixed before you can enter playmode!`\nUnityEditor.SceneView:ShowCompileErrorNotification () (at /Users/bokken/build/output/Unity/Unity/Editor/Mono/SceneView/SceneView.cs:4258)\n\n<!here> How can I fix this?", "channel": "C08R27X0EAH", "thread_ts": "1757349785.790919", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1757361416.778639", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Service