, "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0009_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": [{"blocks": [{"alt_text": "a cat is standing in front of a door next to a litter box .", "block_id": "8def7154-73c0-4f0a-a592-4b74e2a6cf40", "fallback": "220x220px image", "image_bytes": 296020, "image_height": 220, "image_url": "https://media.tenor.com/_hUq1BSUsiMAAAAM/cat-cute.gif", "image_width": 220, "is_animated": true, "title": {"emoji": true, "text": "GIF", "type": "plain_text"}, "type": "image"}], "fallback": "shared a GIF", "id": 1}]}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R8CHB0QL/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/257", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0e21093a33f29269df89b9a64927c275", "ts": "1759160753.470909", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It looks super cute and polished", "channel": "C08R8CHB0QL", "thread_ts": "1759159849.386619", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0033_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C08R8CHB0QL/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/268", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "cf1bc6c82af4f57dc5228dd0f6d38350", "ts": "1759248458.722989", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Oh, I can see so many possibilities of cancer levels with those pigs and mixing mugs with the frizbees :[USERNAME_21162]:", "channel": "C08R8CHB0QL", "thread_ts": "1759248458.722989", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1759248778.543629", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/20", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9ceef23b697b2885daba28eb7cb21343", "ts": "1756753330.834719", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "That's not okay, it needs to be a small orange item. We can put orange in instead if the carrot is broken", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/22", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "643e981c6ef47e0735ec187aa1d1a7c0", "ts": "1756753524.353179", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I didn't PR for main", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/23", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "996ca17e943cfd5e1130a2517d31c12e", "ts": "1756753579.508979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> Are you taking a look or do I need to do something as well?", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/29", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "feb808f45e66d9d78fabcc685c39e391", "ts": "1756753824.644169", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "So it needs to be a non poison item right?", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/33", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f84093bafd4f24378477b69b2b824920", "ts": "1756753926.565659", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Can we do that if its not a problem for the card progression? That level is working well", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/34", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7bd8c3015a7962548aa4e7c70030f634", "ts": "1756753934.887979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I mean in the funnel data", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/36", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2ec07408618f7dc2644426e6d9dcfdad", "ts": "1756754026.791539", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Let's chop off 2 zombies then. It's already a big increase in the item pool for level 2", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/40", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7b1a49992e9423e27d6f3dfed8339c8d", "ts": "1756754644.757479", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yup, which branch?", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/42", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "d91a8660c41f5f84bba4661d61b27821", "ts": "1756754753.781049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Did we merge that to main?", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/47", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "bfc04bd86953efee8e8a04b3a92fbb9f", "ts": "1756755079.847089", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I cut off the zombie heads", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756753216.592999", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/48", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_S