, "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756762375.070229", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/75", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "31fbf95a0e1ee89bd5c159f9e7956b31", "ts": "1756826269.968319", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah let's do 80. We can always increase the difficulty", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756762375.070229", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/76", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "740f9d3ce9528ed4c5914da850707893", "ts": "1756826278.543769", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "A gentler curve will be better I think", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756762375.070229", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/77", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "6a1d33cb0093593a89d7a4d92e982bfa", "ts": "1756829985.398369", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Level 33 prewarm was set at 10 seconds and no monsters before so that was the issue. I'll send the fix now", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/78", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "64003fd9e38a29dadfcad8a4e0ab8dbb", "ts": "1756830054.561669", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_0050] please take a look at level 5 and 33, I sent the fixes", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/79", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e431405854f9ba3520ff97be04d32598", "ts": "1756830078.707459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "And the nuke problem is still between level 20-30?", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756830078.707459", "reply_count": 3, "reply_users_count": 2, "latest_reply": "1756830216.436639", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/84", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0dcfe39981f4176343ed1636f62b3f98", "ts": "1756838780.659279", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey, guys. We just finished talking with [PERSON_NAME_0029]. And basically:\n\n\u2022 Don't use Domino Delights documents for Zombie Match features, please. The system can be the same but There are nuances that create edge cases. For example, with daily login, because we don't have a queue manager yet, he had to do something else with the animations and that was one of the issues in the last week's meetings.  \n\u2022 Because [PERSON_NAME_0029] tends to do small tasks and they can be popping in and out, he struggles with prioritization. Please take extra care with his tickets and consider his other tickets when you set priority for a new ticket. \n\u2022 Engineers struggle when documents are incomplete in quantity, a simple reward on our document can mean a bigger task on the client or backend side we can't anticipate as designers, so please make sure your documents are completed in this regard before you kickoff a feature. \n\u2022 We did remind him we expect documents to be a guide of its own without additional tickets. So let's make sure our documentation is complete at best we can.   ", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 4, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/98", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c77bf65fe2f7ef3ffa4dace4c5588193", "ts": "1756990809.900749", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Guys, when the first wave is like this, meaning There can and cannot be a monster before the prewarm, the level will \"sometimes\" end prematurely. Let's avoid this situation. I think that's the cause of \"I entered a level again and it ended prematurely\" bug.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756990809.900749", "reply_count": 9, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1757008704.274459", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [{"created": 1756990743, "display_as_bot": false, "editable": false, "external_type": "", "file_access": "visible", "filetype": "png", "has_rich_preview": false, "id": "F09DN950YR2", "is_external": false, "is_public": false, "is_starred": false, "media_display_type": "unknown", "mimetype": "image/png", "mode": "hosted", "name": "image.png", "original_h": 1090, "original_w": 910, "permalink": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/files/EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID/F09DN950YR2/image.png", "permalink_public": "https://slack-files.com/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-a2dd942124", "pretty_type": "PNG", "public_url_shared": false, "size": 390611, "skipped_shares": true, "thumb_1024": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_1024.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_1024_h": 1024, "thumb_1024_w": 855, "thumb_160": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_160.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_360": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_360.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_360_h": 360, "thumb_360_w": 301, "thumb_480": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_480.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_480_h": 480, "thumb_480_w": 401, "thumb_64": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_64.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_720": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_720.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_720_h": 720, "thumb_720_w": 601, "thumb_80": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_80.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_800": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_800.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_800_h": 958, "thumb_800_w": 800, "thumb_960": "https://files.slack.com/files-tmb/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2-dd0c7549e6/image_960.png?t=xoxb-REDACTED", "thumb_960_h": 960, "thumb_960_w": 801, "thumb_tiny": "", "timestamp": 1756990743, "title": "image.png", "url_private": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2/image.png?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_private_download": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09DN950YR2/download/image.png?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "user_team": "T04RZ2JAMM0", "username": ""}], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/100", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "ca85547f1f16170fa1fde41a6d14cf32", "ts": "1756990976.290069", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_37557], I was just at that level lol", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756990809.900749", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/101", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "04045d7d5de2ac7b20f9904dc6de4680", "ts": "1756990987.192519", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Like this screenshot was from level 23 :[USERNAME_1653]:", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1756990809.900749", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/103", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f9a8c83a6bd05c9cd153dc4971ac798b", "ts": "1756998135.910459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I started going over the levels again after the power change. Most levels are out of whack, especially after 10. But it's a  relatively quick process and I'm adjusting the monster tracks again as well as placing the correct item introduction levels and reinserting the levels that we took out to place intro levels in <@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID>", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/104", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "4771ac1ea60f740a350dce2d853ea385", "ts": "1756999698.545429", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm also noticing whenever we have a different start and end count it can throw the balance off more than before. I think moving forward we should be more specific with zombies. With the same bot speed, I can get both leftovers and I can get the nuke.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/106", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0bbba59d41bf44e71594764db0f3dd59", "ts": "1756999871.022199", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Until such time, let's micromanage the shit out of them :[USERNAME_1653]:", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "laughing", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/108", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "106f5e086074d620b63b2680aac78543", "ts": "1757001203.257169", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'd rather finish the first 120 level balance before making a PR if that's okay. But if you guys want to merge I can send cherry picks too.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/109", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2594d3c462b4ee4416604eb614a5dd23", "ts": "1757006744.946909", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Shared this canvas: F09A1MFB7UY", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": "canvas_sharing_message", "reactions": [], "files": [{"access": "write", "canvas_creator_id": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "canvas_printing_enabled": true, "canvas_readtime": 1.4733038940185, "created": 1754552392, "display_as_bot": false, "editable": true, "external_type": "", "file_access": "visible", "filetype": "quip", "has_rich_preview": false, "id": "F09A1MFB7UY", "is_ai_suggested": false, "is_external": false, "is_public": false, "is_restricted_sharing_enabled": false, "is_starred": false, "mimetype": "application/vnd.slack-docs", "mode": "quip", "name": "VariantC", "org_or_workspace_access": "none", "permalink": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/docs/T04RZ2JAMM0/F09A1MFB7UY", "permalink_public": "https://slack-files.com/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY-9f2d6f5f8f", "pretty_type": "Canvas", "public_url_shared": false, "quip_thread_id": "FIS9AAXwKf6", "size": 2706, "skipped_shares": true, "team_pref_version_history_enabled": true, "teams_shared_with": [], "timestamp": 1754552392, "title": "[USERNAME_4013]", "title_blocks": [{"block_id": "yVBPA", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "[USERNAME_4013]", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "update_notification": 1757351660, "updated": 1757506711, "url_private": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY/canvas?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_private_download": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY/download/canvas?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_static_preview": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/docs/T04RZ2JAMM0/F09A1MFB7UY/mobile", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "user_team": "T04RZ2JAMM0", "username": ""}], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/110", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2b5757ab0f38afc9b933b8c16a277724", "ts": "1757006759.987879", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [{"access": "write", "canvas_creator_id": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "canvas_printing_enabled": true, "canvas_readtime": 1.4733038940185, "created": 1754552392, "display_as_bot": false, "editable": true, "external_type": "", "file_access": "visible", "filetype": "quip", "has_rich_preview": false, "id": "F09A1MFB7UY", "is_ai_suggested": false, "is_external": false, "is_public": false, "is_restricted_sharing_enabled": false, "is_starred": false, "mimetype": "application/vnd.slack-docs", "mode": "quip", "name": "VariantC", "org_or_workspace_access": "none", "permalink": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/docs/T04RZ2JAMM0/F09A1MFB7UY", "permalink_public": "https://slack-files.com/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY-9f2d6f5f8f", "pretty_type": "Canvas", "public_url_shared": false, "quip_thread_id": "FIS9AAXwKf6", "size": 2706, "skipped_shares": true, "team_pref_version_history_enabled": true, "teams_shared_with": [], "timestamp": 1754552392, "title": "[USERNAME_4013]", "title_blocks": [{"block_id": "yVBPA", "elements": [{"elements": [{"text": "[USERNAME_4013]", "type": "text"}], "type": "rich_text_section"}], "type": "rich_text"}], "update_notification": 1757351660, "updated": 1757506711, "url_private": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY/canvas?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_private_download": "https://files.slack.com/files-pri/T04RZ2JAMM0-F09A1MFB7UY/download/canvas?token=xoxb-REDACTED", "url_static_preview": "https://harmonygamesgroup.slack.com/docs/T04RZ2JAMM0/F09A1MFB7UY/mobile", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "user_team": "T04RZ2JAMM0", "username": ""}], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/111", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2a8a28aeda94a0ea666df8272db162d7", "ts": "1757006790.235309", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm inserting the level guideline canvas here as well <@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID>", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/113", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c3265526e7b05c36fc8adfd7e90b2b9a", "ts": "1757008320.320389", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> Guys I'm also noticing some monsters that are not varC tagged in the monster tracks. Please be careful with those and let's delete the unused monsters after tomorrows build. They can end levels prematurely too since they are not boss tagged.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757008320.320389", "reply_count": 4, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1757009202.467639", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/122", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "02f72816d8673f9c32212244db6afbd2", "ts": "1757009202.467639", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm just putting it out There as a general reminder. The one I noticed was one of my levels", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757008320.320389", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/127", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c3b289a72d51a5cc4013ab4c798eb543", "ts": "1757104019.578149", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "We're all done with the new levels, guys. Need to control off-balance between 50 and 100 and we'll be done", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/134", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "652856f67ee94e1df6d6c6e70910f887", "ts": "1757338946.865689", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Thanks for the list [PERSON_NAME_0050], I'll check these out. This is super helpful :[USERNAME_26053]:", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/135", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7868e4d99b9bdcb6b3f0fa3cb34adf84", "ts": "1757338977.703459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "New rule is that, whatever you equipped comes extra onto your pile", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 32, "reply_users_count": 3, "latest_reply": "1757347137.685039", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "saluting_face", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/137", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "3c5d86a85bcd8442838e0f00508f06d6", "ts": "1757341443.097519", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "That's what I asked for", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/150", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "ad57931223b2c0b1ae2e0026ad44f55f", "ts": "1757346584.480749", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I asked [PERSON_NAME_5466] how to play with the insertion amounts. I'll balance it today. I think 2-3 pairs from each slot will do nicely. And if the experience is good we can base it on the rarity later", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/154", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "b5e5c3196269dd0b0fe4423223ee2716", "ts": "1757346646.758739", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I never specified how many pairs should be insterted so maybe when [PERSON_NAME_5466] stopped the replacements the system defaulted to a single pair. I'll find out and fix today", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/158", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7685ff7fe4ddef8e0a731c5ffdf607e3", "ts": "1757346843.737539", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah, I contacted him already", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/164", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "98d17c9c9e7b831fc9d86754e71bf091", "ts": "1757346970.284819", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Well we did keep the items in the level to minimum spesifically for that reason", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/167", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "bc7713d395297364d0481f86097fafc9", "ts": "1757347137.685039", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yes, we have too many mechanics", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757338977.703459", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/172", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "318941257e364c40fca1bcdb7eabdcc2", "ts": "1757362253.971639", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> I'm simulating your reported levels at 150 CPM to get the nuke. Exactly at what speed are you playtesting these damned levels :[USERNAME_25002]:", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757362253.971639", "reply_count": 1, "reply_users_count": 1, "latest_reply": "1757362455.298529", "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/174", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "55fc082f29cf226ffb10e634dee89915", "ts": "1757367863.578979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hey, guys. I tested everything at 150 CPM and went over the levels [PERSON_NAME_0050] reported. I think they'll be fine now. Also [PERSON_NAME_0092] mentioned we have the bike kid at level 17 before his introduction so I fixed that too. (thanks for catching that). And level 79 won't be an immediate bike kid death now.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/175", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9500bc660c958b894c8e8354a4b3e039", "ts": "1757367874.407039", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "All pushed to the new design branch we made", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/180", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "6480d5ba5317012e89f51e48ac377bf7", "ts": "1757373874.709619", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It can add to the pile as normal, I think that's okay for now", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757369011.168619", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/181", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "682c75d3404ec57dfd485eb5f318eb92", "ts": "1757373887.104909", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "But f you have a different idea", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757369011.168619", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/199", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "71fd0053f1edc88f669b127361d10ddb", "ts": "1757447265.501889", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'm sending a fix for level 11 now", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/200", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "d26991e5f40002615913455664460803", "ts": "1757447268.932829", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Other stuff we balanced yesterday", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/201", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "ac05a4733cac383466dc58299653e57a", "ts": "1757447528.223459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID> Okay, done", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/206", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2af75a86a95c9e836ddde4bac49b5b5b", "ts": "1757448801.998719", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I balanced it yesterday", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/207", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "ef0626508ceec7c6cf6c0cccfdec2179", "ts": "1757448827.192789", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "<@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> if you're done with your stuff we can make the PR", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/211", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "5bd2d4cb0ca5022bd4ad1eaceb7777f8", "ts": "1757449267.705579", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_57565] made the PR", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757445900.258479", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/240", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e13dbb5650042f7c560f2219d9073a6b", "ts": "1757486891.196939", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "You shouldn't have got the nuke, I'll need to check that level again. It should only have 4 monsters now", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757463859.620729", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/241", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f859dea5253c384257e7a11aa2a1a297", "ts": "1757486907.060689", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "That's be good I think", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757464517.784799", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/242", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "266556f47da4c2840960beeeee2159cd", "ts": "1757486959.759649", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'd say leave as is, if the level is fun they won't notice a multishot in level 32. Multishot gets introduced much later anyway", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757468174.976609", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/243", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7db7c4f7c308601a12d56b97cf968c3c", "ts": "1757487035.104699", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "We can spread them out a little more for the time being but if we have budget we can generate and send them to that outsource team asap, my AI generation funnel is pretty solid.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757480544.414889", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/246", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9eb32b0d3e3468748e639460a8121bf6", "ts": "1757490903.394599", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I'll talk with Marcus about the cost of color change and adding some accesories that don't require more bones, he should come online in a few hours. And we can talk about the cost in the art meeting today, if that sounds good to you.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757480544.414889", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/251", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "3436c1fabd4990eac4d2d2c315b385cb", "ts": "1757518841.304789", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I noticed that too during my playtest 1-10 even has too much. I'll fix those", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "pray", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/263", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "d8d1cc4dae0314d4acf3645c779dd3b7", "ts": "1757608321.547839", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "*Visual Level Guide* \n\n<https://docs.google.com/presentation/d/18GdSRwiLy0y23hT5sOjYTMox85Qk1vunQ2XE7gplz1U/edit?slide=id.p#slide=id.p>", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 2, "name": "heart", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID", "EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/267", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "62ed1e924e60914d2a41ad7fcefb3ed6", "ts": "1757610131.672669", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Since we based the funnel on simple levels with card portfolio building, I prefer the difficulty increase to come from monsters primarily. So that the core meta remains \"improve your pool of items --> beat zombie with it\". The levels already pose a challenge in and of itself, we shouldn't mess more There.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/268", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "baed2b7eebc22e6505149ea241bced73", "ts": "1757610163.214279", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "But I need to look at the dynamic difficulty document again, I'm pretty sure what I'm saying is very far off from what we currently have.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/326", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "50877921c63b291844dd0f0fde1a141a", "ts": "1757618525.209819", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "*Julia Lawson*  <https://harmonygamesgroup.Slack.com/archives/C08R6BF4ENN/p1752255518429929|Jul 11th at 8:38 PM>\n[PERSON_NAME_0022] [PERSON_NAME_47022]\n\nHey, guys. Because I'm very busy these days supporting the art team and because trophy road is now very interwined with the FTUE, I asked <@EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID> to take ownership of the feature. I will support you guys with artwork that's needed for the containers etc. But moving forward, please direct your questions and QA requests to [PERSON_NAME_0092]. (edited)\n\n<@EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID> I transfered this feature to [PERSON_NAME_0092] in July.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757617127.228699", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/327", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c8b3cc5a1d8468c16e781f0970ef0088", "ts": "1757618597.984089", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "But I can be definitely more mindful since I asked for trophy road to include items and zombies in accordance with the new funnel.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757617127.228699", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/329", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "39fc920fef2fae93015a6231c5cc9a05", "ts": "1757619302.815069", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's totally okay. My fault for not delegating when you were away :confused:", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757617127.228699", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/333", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "f737f98af95b4b3ec81dcfe0d5b82466", "ts": "1757620176.179419", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Just to make sure this won't happen again, as we talked in the pod meeting I'm under the impression that <@EMPLOYEE_0016_SLACK_ID> <@EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID> are dealing with the trophy road funnel changes. If you guys need more input from me, I can just take the ownership of iteration again.", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757617127.228699", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}, {"count": 1, "name": "gratitude-thank-you", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0038_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/C090N54TG79/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/373", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7e3894ccdacf734517f54ea789200781", "ts": "1757938974.559979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yes we had a churn on it so I simplified it for this funnel from the first image to the second. I don't know why the easier version caused a bigger churn though", "channel": "C090N54TG79", "thread_ts": "1757713225.482519", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [{"created": 1757938946, "display_as_bot": 