953], [PERSON_NAME_67607]", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/38", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "b31b6aceece88cd13947c09f6daeb2cb", "ts": "1757687462.131579", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hi\u00e7bir s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131 yok \u015fefim, [PERSON_NAME_49366] anlad\u0131m ve yat\u0131\u015ft\u0131rd\u0131m", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/41", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "80542a29af0ca687f28c864735c1710d", "ts": "1757687557.913419", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_77213] sana bir tavsiye, [PERSON_NAME_0054]'i s\u0131k\u0131\u015ft\u0131r b\u00f6yle durumlarda kendin girip u\u011fra\u015fma. Bu \u015fekilde u\u011fra\u015ft\u0131\u011f\u0131n her \u015fey g\u00f6revin haline geliyor ve \u00e7ok bunal\u0131yorsun.", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/42", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "fa18c1c8929d22f9858584771daf6e53", "ts": "1757687596.950679", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_77215], levellere girme trophy 