 "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "a968e9ab1d880082815bd95eaa8c2435", "ts": "1757687715.368959", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "bana 9 paragraf sitem [USERNAME_21528] Ge\u00e7en", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/57", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "4d51a74e3906554557e7501c86b69d6a", "ts": "1757687733.991899", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[USERNAME_15472]", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/60", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "8b0c672076be461bec44a655ba0e9bba", "ts": "1757687760.621679", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "\u0130\u015fte azarlar tarzda konu\u015fmu\u015fum bilmem ne", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/61", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "119e3ffbc5a99f9db49a0d79fab48e6c", "ts": "1757687768.612849", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "\u00c7emkirtme o zaman a\u015flsdk\u015fas", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/63", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2e6c6e242f8373820192587b3de0b2a4", "ts": "1757687787.569729", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hi\u00e7 umrumda de\u011fil, terbiyesizlik yapmad\u0131m bir \u015fey yapmad\u0131m", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/66", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "50de398c3da7cb2665468ae320f562d8", "ts": "1757687808.437709", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "O \u015fey istiyor tart\u0131\u015fma olsun o tezini savunsun b\u00f6ylece bulletproof oldu\u011fu ortaya \u00e7\u0131ks\u0131n. [PERSON_NAME_70757] hepten yanl\u0131\u015fs\u0131n diyince al\u0131n\u0131yor", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/67", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "939e51d548c2368708ce71b4cdb44339", "ts": "1757687874.073399", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Onu da anl\u0131yorum, aylard\u0131r bunlara u\u011fra\u015f\u0131yor ama realitede benim yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131m 100 leveli itere ediyor aylard\u0131r. Kendince benim \"\u00e7ok derin \u00e7al\u0131\u015fma olmadan\" yapt\u0131\u011f\u0131m leveller metrik getirince normal bu \u015fekilde davranmas\u0131, yine de iyi idare etti, al\u00e7akg\u00f6n\u00fcll\u00fc davrand\u0131", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/71", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "903c58151f569b2866b39fede40e3dc8", "ts": "1757688093.603449", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Toparlayamad\u0131k ama toparlamam\u0131za da gerek yok, oyunun toparlanmas\u0131 gerekli sadece", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/73", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "d8be9218057bd86e6c70917f76879c48", "ts": "1757688137.273889", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[USERNAME_21531] [PERSON_NAME_0054]'e sugarcoat etmeden hay\u0131r diyen tek ki\u015fi benim, bunu fark edecek bir noktada", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "100", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0012_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/74", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "9de5a96c1657d012928e3fe1b0d19d36", "ts": "1757688175.233049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "\u015eurda 2 ay kalm\u0131\u015f b\u00fct\u00fcn d\u00fczenimizin bozulmas\u0131na, oyunu toparlayabilece\u011fimi biliyorum, motive etmeye \u00e7al\u0131\u015f\u0131yorum kendimi o y\u00fczden di\u011fer her \u015feyi shut down ettim", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/79", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "371a2d963b4496c0a8df28cf61e073c6", "ts": "1757688254.771109", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Evet bu funnel de g\u00fczel getirirse d3 falan, o zaman art\u0131k kart say\u0131s\u0131n\u0131 azalt\u0131p efektleri yapt\u0131rmak konusunda ikna edicem ordan da y\u00fcr\u00fcr\u00fcz zaten sonraki ad\u0131m monetize etmek", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/80", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1e9349d3785d3488010df25cd53b7a8d", "ts": "1757688263.011929", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Bakal\u0131m olursa olur", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/84", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1f1b4b38c5b807bd872fa7aa844278aa", "ts": "1757688402.113049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "d1 35-38 d2 28-30 falan olmas\u0131 laz\u0131m ama \u015fu an 25 falan olursa tamam", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/86", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1aa479d55ffccc56d3469d4b6e87957a", "ts": "1757688674.193549", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "O g\u00fcnlerimiz \u00e7ok gerilerde kald\u0131 a\u015fskdl\u015fsakd", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/87", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e22b5c5f14e498e6f545a21353077be3", "ts": "1757688682.653509", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ke\u015fke bir art need i\u00e7in 2 hafta g\u00f6md\u00fc\u011f\u00fcm\u00fcz kadar param\u0131z olsa yine [USERNAME_21538]", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QA585LTY/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/90", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1db5b0fa4fda631ff2f4eb8ab63210ef", "ts": "1757932295.792899", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_65732], dataya bakmak istiyorum da son build'in numaras\u0131 neydi?", "channel": "D05QA585LTY", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count