2534.710819", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "You're right, I'm sorry :confused:", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": "1756812496.437499", "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/47", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "e55f6aa7db2276cd41e03d73a6fd80a7", "ts": "1756812746.940649", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yes, it looks like they changed that too. Let me just write in the channel so that you don't have to change something again.", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/49", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "527e030c1d2d6aa9a29933bf1f836804", "ts": "1756812868.370819", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Yeah, they don't exactly consider those when they are constantly playing with this stuff.", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/51", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "557a9587d6636d6fd86c703e9866c828", "ts": "1756812900.261729", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Just saw, thanks.", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0033_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/52", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "eda7b66d25eb981b94d62719110fc86b", "ts": "1756891052.465809", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hi, Martin. I'm running a horrible fever. I'll sign off after I do the things I need to generate for you. We're missing the last two images right?", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/54", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0a43cd56059d1b43bf6461c25b11ee9a", "ts": "1756891135.013889", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's not so terrible yet. I'd rather unblock you before signing off", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/56", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "61a64c9b1987a20c5ffce4b2055bdc35", "ts": "1756891174.978449", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "So for splash we can make the table come onto the middle zombie and then smaller tables fly to the zombies on the side", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/57", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "835dc6cb318a4f90bac3217f94800a2b", "ts": "1756891224.651359", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "And for multishot we can have a generic zombie head and items just raining on him. You made other items flying in one trajectory and we can make 3 trajectories with generic zombie head", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/58", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "546ea40c7f1fa9bd3c445eb716b52774", "ts": "1756891243.340219", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Those are my ideas, I think they get the point across. But if you don't like them or have other ideas I'm open to suggestions.", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/60", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c00e972ac81d1db659b49fa57c72ea02", "ts": "1756891387.065809", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "So when splash happens, you hit one zombie and it has a small area effect, dealing less damage to that area", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/61", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "dd8844d2ba92a1f4392ce10eb193ab00", "ts": "1756891399.567729", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "It's just an AoE spell", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/64", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "dc7d3afe8427a8ce99d111a03885e3c0", "ts": "1756892113.577149", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "We can generate some scissors. What kind do you want?", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/67", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "8dc490a1df800e23e1b558e6ec9a9aef", "ts": "1756892153.717609", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Me no understand :smile:", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/69", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "5a435708bd30d8bac4ba9df8b2c03c3b", "ts": "1756892283.194389", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ohh, lol, I get it now :[USERNAME_7156]:", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/70", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "35b0c3acc178c06b20098a2b0d5b5954", "ts": "1756892297.785129", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "So what do I need to give to you scissors or pan?", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/72", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "a0ad0034a5be18fd5c39516471f518d5", "ts": "1756892322.909809", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Best work ever :[USERNAME_1653]:", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/75", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "87112d0760b24f6faf56783a4fcb84f7", "ts": "1756892369.228969", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "I tried some things but they were horrific I'll show you :smile:", "channel": "D05QESBD4HW", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D05QESBD4HW/2025-