l, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/2", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "71786f400e21cde1a29367803773f5dd", "ts": "1756709410.905699", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Company internal'a yazd\u0131m yani", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/4", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "efc9f064ee6f304588b6e2600e664a5a", "ts": "1756711124.922459", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ben se bug\u00fcn de tatil diye birle\u015ftirdin [USERNAME_3915]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/10", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "13744b617277c3c564791fb8bd9dd790", "ts": "1756826371.930849", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Sen ak\u015fam [PERSON_NAME_0029]'yla olan toplant\u0131ya gelebilir misin bu arada", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/12", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "2ef479bfda53842f39f2b5e4e4e9f40c", "ts": "1756826426.043249", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Dok\u00fcmanlarla ilgili s\u0131k\u0131nt\u0131s\u0131 varm\u0131\u015f kral\u0131n", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/14", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "70854939a7b574fc1e5330d134e28439", "ts": "1756826537.005449", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Biraz \u00fcst\u00fcne gitmeyi d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcn\u00fcyorum destek atar m\u0131s\u0131n?", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/17", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "236a3070e5f13a5e5d277587a0325d59", "ts": "1756838133.848979", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Ha onu anlad\u0131m \u015fefim ya. Benim derdim ona hayat\u0131n ger\u00e7eklerini hat\u0131rlatmakt\u0131 san\u0131r\u0131m yeterli rand\u0131man\u0131 da ald\u0131k", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/18", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7b7dcc49be479fead50254c06a162460", "ts": "1756838145.925129", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Sen yokken de [PERSON_NAME_0050] [USERNAME_33376]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/21", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "974bf2eb459787fe86db619a42237fd8", "ts": "1756838188.541869", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Sen de iyi ki arka \u00e7\u0131kacakt\u0131n hemen ticketlar\u0131n\u0131 yaziyim dedin alksdlas", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/22", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "c85babd3038f2c05b095b19b493e7955", "ts": "1756838206.578049", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "bi de bana trip at\u0131yo h\u0131\u0131 o zaman her \u015fey oldu\u011fu gibi kals\u0131n diye [USERNAME_33378]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/23", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "7b62f4538f16fd65c8b40bff5f1f22d1", "ts": "1756838224.443099", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "yok kalmas\u0131n [PERSON_NAME_0029]'cum seni mi k\u0131racaz", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/24", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "0ab7dd0895f2f41fbcb6f6b97aa1691f", "ts": "1756838249.304969", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Bence m\u00fchendislerin aras\u0131ndaki ileti\u015fim de yeterince sorunlu bu arada onu fark ettim", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/30", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "8bd8355e40d9e71dca5ab7e8d18e3baf", "ts": "1756840412.058499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Geri vites yapma [PERSON_NAME_0029] Anadolu \u00e7ocu\u011fu yemez :laughing:", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/34", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "17005efc63cefcd32906bacf782c0cdb", "ts": "1757104153.577329", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hee bu ak\u015fam burday\u0131m", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/35", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "6b928c5f8105c226a60cf2245dfd0a02", "ts": "1757104157.280009", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_138220]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/39", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "4b5a5b47737fbe11c817e8478f6c5757", "ts": "1757104236.255709", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Hee, anlad\u0131m. Nas\u0131l Qa yap\u0131yorsun onu bi de", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/43", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "1727727ed4a2b61ea24be6439f824f3d", "ts": "1757104313.435419", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Onu kimse d\u00fc\u015f\u00fcnm\u00fcyor zaten \u015faskd\u015faksl\u015fdas", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/45", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "786ccf5b574442e4a2b732d3cf06098c", "ts": "1757104342.247499", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[USERNAME_59706] \"Benim i\u00e7in \u00e7ok ge\u00e7 oldu ve investor facing build'e almay\u0131 \u015fu an riskli g\u00f6r\u00fcyorum. Bu gece kals\u0131n diye.\"", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/48", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "aca9f577cbf18341affedaedcf8f0002", "ts": "1757104377.518019", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "Bazen kendimi gen\u00e7 doktor yeti\u015ftiren ya\u015fl\u0131 hem\u015fire gibi hissediyorum seninle [USERNAME_59707]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/52", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "04870aa7ad9fdcb83678be02364c496b", "ts": "1757104407.590319", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "[PERSON_NAME_60385] [PERSON_NAME_138223] [PERSON_NAME_138219], geceyar\u0131s\u0131 olmu\u015f amk onu [USERNAME_59708]", "channel": "D076RBM29JS", "thread_ts": null, "reply_count": 0, "reply_users_count": 0, "latest_reply": null, "is_activity_message": false, "subtype": null, "reactions": [{"count": 1, "name": "+1", "users": ["EMPLOYEE_0026_SLACK_ID"]}], "files": [], "attachments": []}}, {"file": "HarmonyGames_Other_Services/Services_Data/slack/messages/D076RBM29JS/2025-09.json", "pointer": "/56", "field": "user", "value": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "record": {"id": "260eed1f34ea2a8d112de199b9c25a76", "ts": "1757343423.285469", "type": "message", "user": "EMPLOYEE_0005_SLACK_ID", "text": "yok de\u011fi\u015fmedi hata olmu\u015f onu da halledeyim", "c